<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="mY27i" id="mY27i"><span data-lake-id="u0a13f9a7" id="u0a13f9a7">功能描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u014340b1" id="u014340b1"><span data-lake-id="uf1310bdd" id="uf1310bdd">这是一个组合逻辑电路，不带时序的。是从Rocket-Chip中复制粘贴过来的文件。<br />输出是旧数据和AtomicsUnit的操作数，输出是要写回的新数据。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub04cc722" id="ub04cc722"><span data-lake-id="u171935e4" id="u171935e4">计算除了 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u60e9c552" id="u60e9c552">LR SC</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub2a30e3d" id="ub2a30e3d"> 和 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u85770aa1" id="u85770aa1">CAS </span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf9000cc0" id="uf9000cc0">以外的全部原子操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u02a9a69b" id="u02a9a69b"><span data-lake-id="u7d134b10" id="u7d134b10">本模块在Mainpipe处理原子的时候的s3流水线中使用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uccaf2ac5" id="uccaf2ac5"><span data-lake-id="uc7e107bb" id="uc7e107bb">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="CKZ1z" id="CKZ1z"><span data-lake-id="u8f2804b2" id="u8f2804b2">事务描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u133e155d" id="u133e155d"><span data-lake-id="ue0e12184" id="ue0e12184" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">所有 AMO 指令都严格按以下顺序原子执行（不可被打断）：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7e369aa2" id="u7e369aa2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e5e826d" id="u7e5e826d">地址 = GPR[rs1]</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub0fae414" id="ub0fae414"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub253ebdd" id="ub253ebdd">旧值 = Memory[地址]</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u497c0cd1" id="u497c0cd1"><strong><span data-lake-id="uefa32c5f" id="uefa32c5f">结果 = 旧值 op GPR[rs2]</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u286e4a00" id="u286e4a00"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2d5d828" id="ue2d5d828">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9cc7ad6c" id="u9cc7ad6c"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3d23135" id="uf3d23135">GPR[rd] = 旧值</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub101826c" id="ub101826c"><strong><span data-lake-id="uad8d543b" id="uad8d543b">Memory[地址] = 结果</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6287a667" id="u6287a667"><strong><span data-lake-id="u97d3d257" id="u97d3d257">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="uacb16737" id="uacb16737"><span data-lake-id="u0ac9fa1d" id="u0ac9fa1d">将这个模块当成，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubc96af27" id="ubc96af27">旧值 + rs2操作数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u70d02777" id="u70d02777"> 根据 cmd 能得到out的组合逻辑电路即可，其余逻辑如仍需MainPipe来实现。<br />1.旧值放到rd中</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8796a9a6" id="u8796a9a6"><span data-lake-id="u2c227c43" id="u2c227c43">2.out放回rs1地址中</span></p><p data-lake-id="u930d04e4" id="u930d04e4"><span data-lake-id="u56cd9ba3" id="u56cd9ba3">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u8a8f82ca" id="u8a8f82ca"><br></p><ul list="u130ad48b"><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="ub709e63f" id="ub709e63f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ec29811" id="u7ec29811" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amoadd</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7fdd4f49" id="u7fdd4f49" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与 </span><code data-lake-id="u1af49616" id="u1af49616"><span data-lake-id="u6cfd0cca" id="u6cfd0cca" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5503b0c3" id="u5503b0c3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> 进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2a16011" id="ud2a16011" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">加法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50d15e94" id="u50d15e94" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">运算，结果写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="u6ab5beef" id="u6ab5beef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u43dc0c81" id="u43dc0c81" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amoxor</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u49af172c" id="u49af172c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与</span><span data-lake-id="u4af1b4c1" id="u4af1b4c1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> </span><code data-lake-id="ub0c4b9b0" id="ub0c4b9b0"><span data-lake-id="u4f46cd39" id="u4f46cd39" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="uef6a1c7d" id="uef6a1c7d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> </span><span data-lake-id="u7ddd3d6c" id="u7ddd3d6c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9482c3f" id="ub9482c3f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">按位异或</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8de5fd98" id="u8de5fd98" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">运算，结果写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="ub5c46322" id="ub5c46322"><strong><span data-lake-id="u526c956f" id="u526c956f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amoor</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u66f94678" id="u66f94678" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与</span><span data-lake-id="u2959434c" id="u2959434c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> </span><code data-lake-id="u315cf78a" id="u315cf78a"><span data-lake-id="u460011a6" id="u460011a6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="ueff4d6e6" id="ueff4d6e6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> </span><span data-lake-id="u9310bf04" id="u9310bf04" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub60bc09b" id="ub60bc09b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">按位或</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3573560b" id="u3573560b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">运算，结果写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="u782656f8" id="u782656f8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fa15660" id="u0fa15660" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amoand</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud66b4225" id="ud66b4225" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与</span><span data-lake-id="uf839f0f7" id="uf839f0f7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> </span><code data-lake-id="ue8e54505" id="ue8e54505"><span data-lake-id="ue77950bc" id="ue77950bc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="u1a371da6" id="u1a371da6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> </span><span data-lake-id="u56fc6c51" id="u56fc6c51" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0218b1b5" id="u0218b1b5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">按位与</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u17e5061f" id="u17e5061f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">运算，结果写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="ucc93a6ac" id="ucc93a6ac"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub2f8255c" id="ub2f8255c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amomin</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc0328214" id="uc0328214" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与 </span><code data-lake-id="u0ee16c36" id="u0ee16c36"><span data-lake-id="u922f8cd4" id="u922f8cd4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="u7b7e6353" id="u7b7e6353" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> 视为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f8b496a" id="u9f8b496a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">有符号数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u016c0766" id="u016c0766" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">，比较后取</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4b137849" id="u4b137849" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">较小值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u95a1a9db" id="u95a1a9db" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="u5ed9a2bb" id="u5ed9a2bb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4eefb607" id="u4eefb607" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amomax</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc7584a3a" id="uc7584a3a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与 </span><code data-lake-id="u26802570" id="u26802570"><span data-lake-id="uc6bca089" id="uc6bca089" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="u3b72787a" id="u3b72787a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> 视为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4e88910" id="uc4e88910" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">有符号数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub061b430" id="ub061b430" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">，比较后取</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue447deb7" id="ue447deb7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">较大值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u240ad130" id="u240ad130" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="ue2c96be6" id="ue2c96be6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u91072c16" id="u91072c16" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amominu</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf0c7974b" id="uf0c7974b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与 </span><code data-lake-id="ue01d7abb" id="ue01d7abb"><span data-lake-id="uc37976da" id="uc37976da" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="ub5f90ee3" id="ub5f90ee3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> 视为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4df946ff" id="u4df946ff" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">无符号数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub8ea346e" id="ub8ea346e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">，比较后取</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9cdffab" id="ue9cdffab" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">较小值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u61149b44" id="u61149b44" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="u722d6124" id="u722d6124"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue1eefc82" id="ue1eefc82" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amomaxu</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udcfb48d4" id="udcfb48d4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：将内存原值与 </span><code data-lake-id="u7e70e538" id="u7e70e538"><span data-lake-id="ue81dbd9b" id="ue81dbd9b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="u4207a4e1" id="u4207a4e1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> 视为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua0b411fb" id="ua0b411fb" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">无符号数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ube612c3e" id="ube612c3e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">，比较后取</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u97f520f1" id="u97f520f1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">较大值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd7e7c46" id="ucd7e7c46" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">写回内存。</span></li><li fid="ue90a337b" data-lake-id="u754c504c" id="u754c504c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3fca9cf0" id="u3fca9cf0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">amoswap</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u76b05957" id="u76b05957" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">：不进行算术或逻辑运算，直接将 </span><code data-lake-id="u2897ecc6" id="u2897ecc6"><span data-lake-id="uab1987fc" id="uab1987fc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua16222ef" id="ua16222ef" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)"> 的值</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6c50ff7" id="uf6c50ff7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">写入</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0c62c6d8" id="u0c62c6d8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21)">内存，完成交换。你提到的“mask 内等于操作数”是对交换行为的一种描述，即把指定位置的内容替换为操作数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u012cec07" id="u012cec07"><span data-lake-id="u73b2732d" id="u73b2732d">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="CcOvm" id="CcOvm"><span data-lake-id="ubaab0c74" id="ubaab0c74">接口描述</span></h2><table data-lake-id="IydBD" id="IydBD" margin="true" fit-width="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 743px"><colgroup><col width="98"><col width="94"><col width="68"><col width="483"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u752eadfc" id="u752eadfc" style="height: 36px"><td data-lake-id="u0cb0e649" id="u0cb0e649"><p data-lake-id="ub272bbd3" id="ub272bbd3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u7eb25ee2" id="u7eb25ee2" class="lake-fontsize-11">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7ef8249b" id="u7ef8249b"><p data-lake-id="u031c8aa9" id="u031c8aa9" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud8906c16" id="ud8906c16" class="lake-fontsize-11">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u029adf56" id="u029adf56"><p data-lake-id="u5308a7a0" id="u5308a7a0" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ubc613490" id="ubc613490" class="lake-fontsize-11">位宽</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf31a270d" id="uf31a270d"><p data-lake-id="u57446113" id="u57446113" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u1f42f668" id="u1f42f668" class="lake-fontsize-11">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua16b98c1" id="ua16b98c1"><td data-lake-id="u9900e0fe" id="u9900e0fe"><p data-lake-id="u4868ecbc" id="u4868ecbc"><span data-lake-id="u8e2572d0" id="u8e2572d0" class="lake-fontsize-11">cmd</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5725cc1f" id="u5725cc1f"><p data-lake-id="u84dfd41d" id="u84dfd41d"><span data-lake-id="ud63501f7" id="ud63501f7" class="lake-fontsize-11">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud4eb05d3" id="ud4eb05d3"><p data-lake-id="u7c47bf69" id="u7c47bf69"><span data-lake-id="udc245fa6" id="udc245fa6" class="lake-fontsize-11">5</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3c2e5303" id="u3c2e5303"><p data-lake-id="ua1d4b95b" id="ua1d4b95b"><span data-lake-id="ucf23b4a4" id="ucf23b4a4" class="lake-fontsize-11">原子操作类型</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u60f96720" id="u60f96720"><td data-lake-id="u6722749e" id="u6722749e"><p data-lake-id="ucf6b459d" id="ucf6b459d"><span data-lake-id="u86da0799" id="u86da0799" class="lake-fontsize-11">mask</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua5b494d5" id="ua5b494d5"><p data-lake-id="u6b065da0" id="u6b065da0"><span data-lake-id="u7a79b024" id="u7a79b024" class="lake-fontsize-11">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5a2c96fa" id="u5a2c96fa"><p data-lake-id="u1e40db6d" id="u1e40db6d"><span data-lake-id="u989d99df" id="u989d99df" class="lake-fontsize-11">8</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udfcb22d3" id="udfcb22d3"><p data-lake-id="u1029acd0" id="u1029acd0"><span data-lake-id="ud78e29e9" id="ud78e29e9" class="lake-fontsize-11">这个 64 bit bank 里哪些字节参加运算。1 表示参加</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uebf54bfc" id="uebf54bfc"><td data-lake-id="ud26a82f8" id="ud26a82f8"><p data-lake-id="u25fb4e8f" id="u25fb4e8f"><span data-lake-id="u59584ad9" id="u59584ad9" class="lake-fontsize-11">lhs</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua92d11a5" id="ua92d11a5"><p data-lake-id="u38b1de84" id="u38b1de84"><span data-lake-id="u3d267a4b" id="u3d267a4b" class="lake-fontsize-11">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4a2f70c4" id="u4a2f70c4"><p data-lake-id="u5614683b" id="u5614683b"><span data-lake-id="ueec84493" id="ueec84493" class="lake-fontsize-11">64</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3a5cc50a" id="u3a5cc50a"><p data-lake-id="u53d9782a" id="u53d9782a"><span data-lake-id="u29c11684" id="u29c11684" class="lake-fontsize-11">旧数据。来源见下面两行，不是“SRAM 里刚好读到的那一份”</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u5823767b" id="u5823767b"><td data-lake-id="uab0332db" id="uab0332db"><p data-lake-id="u473cf1b2" id="u473cf1b2"><span data-lake-id="ua10039b8" id="ua10039b8" class="lake-fontsize-11">rhs</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud5f2b621" id="ud5f2b621"><p data-lake-id="u05a97a03" id="u05a97a03"><span data-lake-id="u827e9060" id="u827e9060" class="lake-fontsize-11">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub86bd49b" id="ub86bd49b"><p data-lake-id="u18e7162b" id="u18e7162b"><span data-lake-id="ufc73fc01" id="ufc73fc01" class="lake-fontsize-11">64</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc2314915" id="uc2314915"><p data-lake-id="u0c33bb7b" id="u0c33bb7b"><span data-lake-id="uc4946dcd" id="uc4946dcd" class="lake-fontsize-11">AtomicsUnit 送来的操作数。128 bit 请求里取这个 bank 对应的低 64 bit</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u82bf835d" id="u82bf835d"><td data-lake-id="uac9b89a6" id="uac9b89a6"><p data-lake-id="u070e3802" id="u070e3802"><span data-lake-id="u75c6a4d1" id="u75c6a4d1" class="lake-fontsize-11">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u03f6f73b" id="u03f6f73b"><p data-lake-id="u22cc21b2" id="u22cc21b2"><span data-lake-id="u415b4c68" id="u415b4c68" class="lake-fontsize-11">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucbd41abb" id="ucbd41abb"><p data-lake-id="u87dd1639" id="u87dd1639"><span data-lake-id="u26189c01" id="u26189c01" class="lake-fontsize-11">64</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua3634474" id="ua3634474"><p data-lake-id="u90eef9d0" id="u90eef9d0"><span data-lake-id="u7b194287" id="u7b194287" class="lake-fontsize-11">mask 内是运算结果，mask 外保持 lhs</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table data-lake-id="N40lN" id="N40lN" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 652px"><colgroup><col width="188"><col width="214"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u256dc71d" id="u256dc71d"><td data-lake-id="u8ae7a5b0" id="u8ae7a5b0"><p data-lake-id="u73cb8d3b" id="u73cb8d3b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc224a7a0" id="uc224a7a0" class="lake-fontsize-11">cmd</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u085ae1e4" id="u085ae1e4"><p data-lake-id="u20ddf413" id="u20ddf413" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ucef72e8d" id="ucef72e8d" class="lake-fontsize-11">指令</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3407e783" id="u3407e783"><p data-lake-id="uf1e6e86e" id="uf1e6e86e" style="text-align: left"><span 